nodes.body:
@yyihuang I've been following the CAKE work, and saw your recent FlashInfer issue on it: https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/issues/4254. Nice work pushing this forward.

I think bringing CAKE support into SGLang would be quite valuable as well. Rather than moving the full implementation into SGLang, I think it might be cleaner to expose and reuse it through the FlashInfer API. That would avoid duplicating a fairly large amount of implementation code and should make maintenance easier across the two projects.

If this direction sounds reasonable to you, I'd be happy to put together the SGLang integration PR and help move some CAKE KDA as well as some MoE support forward. Let me know what you think. Thanks!

